{
  "_phantom": true,
  "_brand": "TypedHtml",
  "_atoms": { "text": {} },
  "_comment_globals": "Typed globals: a bare string still means String (back-compat), and this brand's ONLY enums are globals — so it also covers the case where <Lib>.Values exists purely because of _globals (K6) and <Lib>.Attributes has to import it without any shared enum attr.",
  "_globals": [
    "class",
    "id",
    "slot",
    "style",
    { "name": "autofocus", "type": "bool" },
    { "name": "tabindex", "type": "int" },
    { "name": "hidden", "type": ["hidden", "until-found"] },
    { "name": "dir", "type": ["ltr", "rtl", "auto"] }
  ],
  "_comment_variants": [
    "`_variants` on the HOME-module shape, over a CONTROLLED base. `value` is in the",
    "default `_controlled` roster, so it emits as a DOM property — and `valueAsNumber`",
    "must therefore write the same property with the same JS type (a string), or",
    "virtual-dom's identity diff and its `value`/`checked` resync special-case break."
  ],
  "_variants": {
    "value": [{ "name": "valueAsNumber", "type": "float" }]
  },
  "_sets": {
    "flow": ["div", "p", "select", "fieldset", "video", "picture", "a"],
    "phrasing": ["span", "a"]
  },
  "_aria": {
    "roles": ["navigation", "presentation", "tab"],
    "states": { "checked": ["true", "false", "mixed"] },
    "universal": ["label", "labelledby"]
  },
  "Div": {
    "home": "Grouping",
    "roles": ["navigation", "presentation"],
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["any"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "P": {
    "home": "Grouping",
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["@phrasing", "shared:text"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Span": {
    "home": "Grouping",
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["shared:text"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Select": {
    "home": "Select",
    "eventPayloads": { "change": { "setter": "onChange", "payload": "targetValue" } },
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["option", "optgroup"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Option": {
    "home": "Select",
    "parents": ["select", "optgroup"],
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["shared:text"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Optgroup": {
    "home": "Select",
    "parents": ["select", "optgroup"],
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["option"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Fieldset": {
    "home": "Form",
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["legend", "div", "p"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Legend": {
    "home": "Form",
    "parents": ["fieldset"],
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["shared:text"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "A": {
    "home": "A",
    "transparent": true
  },
  "Video": {
    "home": "Media",
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["source", "track", "shared:text"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Picture": {
    "home": "Media",
    "admits": { "unnamed": { "kinds": ["pictureSource"], "multi": true } }
  },
  "Source": {
    "home": "Media",
    "parents": ["video"]
  },
  "PictureSource": {
    "home": "Media",
    "parents": ["picture"]
  },
  "Track": {
    "home": "Media",
    "parents": ["video"]
  }
}
